About us

<img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.QEWM6Boy9Z_smvz9ApZdVgHaHa?w=158&h=180&c=7&r=0&o=7&dpr=1.5&pid=1.7&rm=3" alt="Cutie Pie Bakery">

Cutie Pie is a small bakery located in San Luis Obispo, California. We specialize in making delicious baked goods that are as cute as they are tasty. Our team of skilled bakers uses only the finest ingredients to create treats that will delight your taste buds and bring a smile to your face.

Don't just come for the goods, come for the experience. Our bakery is a cozy and welcoming space where you can relax and enjoy your treats with friends and family. We also offer custom orders for special occasions, so you can make your celebrations even sweeter.

Started in 2010. We continue to grow and expand our offerings, but we remain committed to our original mission of creating cute and delicious baked goods that bring joy to our customers. Thank you for supporting our small business, and we look forward to serving you soon!

Come visit us for a delightful experience.


